                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "The inverse teleporter is a modified teleporter which will teleport you to a random position outside the ship.",
                        "target":  "反向传送器是改装传送器，会把你传送到飞船外的随机位置。",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=medium-exact-help; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Go here to drop off any valuable scrap you\u0027ve collected while on the job. The rate of return updates hourly and fluctuates over the course of several days.",
                        "target":  "前往此处交付工作中收集的贵重废料。回收率每小时更新，并会在数日内波动。",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=medium-exact-help; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Used to communicate with any crew member from any distance, no walkie talkie required! The horn can be heard from anywhere. But what does it mean? That\u0027s up to you",
                        "target":  "可与任意距离外的船员通信，不需要对讲机！号角在任何地方都能听见。但它代表什么？由你决定",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=medium-exact-help; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Press the button to activate the teleporter. It will teleport whoever is currently being monitored on the ship\u0027s radar. They will not be able to keep any of their held items through the teleport. It takes about ten seconds to recharge",
                        "target":  "按下按钮启动传送器。它会传送当前由飞船雷达监控的目标。被传送者无法保留手持物品。充能约需十秒",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=long-product-config; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Press the button to activate the teleporter. It will teleport whoever is currently being monitored on the ship\u0027s radar. They will not be able to keep any of their held items through the teleport. It takes about ten seconds to recharge.",
                        "target":  "按下按钮启动传送器。它会传送当前由飞船雷达监控的目标。被传送者无法保留手持物品。充能约需十秒。",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=long-product-config; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "The inverse teleporter is a modified teleporter which will teleport you to a random position outside the ship. All your items will be dropped at the teleporter before transport. The inverse teleporter can be used by everyone at once and has a 3.5 minute cooldown",
                        "target":  "反向传送器是改造版传送器，会把你传送到飞船外的随机位置。传送前你的所有物品会掉在传送器旁。反向传送器可让所有人同时使用，冷却时间为 3.5 分钟。",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=long-product-config; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Ordered the Company Cruiser. Your new balance is [playerCredits].\n\nWe are so confident in the quality of this product, it comes with a life-time warranty! If your Cruiser is lost or destroyed, you can get one free replacement. Items cannot be purchased while the vehicle is en route.\n\n",
                        "target":  "已订购公司巡航车。你的新余额为 [playerCredits]。\n\n我们对这件产品的质量很有信心，因此附带终身保修！如果巡航车遗失或被摧毁，你可获得一次免费替换。车辆在运输途中时无法购买物品。\n\n",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=long-product-config; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Ordered the inverse teleporter! Your new balance is [playerCredits].\nPress [B] to rearrange objects in your ship and [V] to confirm.\n\nPress the button and step onto the inverse teleporter while it activates.\n",
                        "target":  "已订购反向传送器！你的新余额为 [playerCredits]。\n按 [B] 重新摆放飞船内物品，按 [V] 确认。\n\n启动后站上反向传送器，它会在激活时把你送出飞船。\n",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=long-product-config; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Ordered the teleporter! Your new balance is [playerCredits].\nPress the button to activate the teleporter. It will teleport whoever is currently being monitored on the ship\u0027s radar. You will not be able to keep any of your held items through the teleport. It takes about 10 seconds to recharge.\n\nPress [B] to rearrange objects in your ship and [V] to confirm.",
                        "target":  "已订购传送器！你的新余额为 [playerCredits]。\n按下按钮即可启动传送器。它会传送当前由飞船雷达监控的目标。传送时无法保留任何手持物品。充能约需 10 秒。\n\n按 [B] 重新摆放飞船内物品，按 [V] 确认。",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=long-product-config; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "DISCLAIMER: The inverse teleporter can only transport you out, not in, and you may become trapped. The Company is not responsible for injury or replacement of heads and limbs induced by quantum entanglement and bad luck",
                        "target":  "免责声明：反向传送器只能把你送出去，不能把你送回来，你可能会被困住。因量子纠缠和坏运气导致的受伤、头部或肢体更换，公司概不负责",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=short-technical-residue; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Days on the job: 25\nScrap value collected: $530\nItems bought: 89521\nDeaths: 3651\nSteps taken: 60816069\n",
                        "target":  "工作天数：25\n已收集废料价值：$530\n购买物品数：89521\n死亡次数：3651\n行走步数：60816069\n",
