                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "V80 includes a full rework of March, 3 new creatures, and numerous misc. gameplay improvements and settings, as well as overhauls to increase performance.\nThe next update will include more creatures and scrap.\n\nOthers must update their game to play with you on this version.\n\n\nHave fun!",
                        "target":  "V80 包含对 March 的完整重做、3 种新生物，以及许多杂项玩法改进和设置；同时还进行了多项提升性能的重构。\n下一次更新会加入更多生物和废料。\n\n其他玩家必须更新游戏，才能在这个版本与你同玩。\n\n\n祝你玩得开心！",
